False
True
False
Speed Turtle 50
Write "Enter polygon count: "
polygons = Read Number
Write "Enter side count: "
sides = Read Number
Write "Enter side length: "
length = Read Number

For p = 1 To polygons
    ' Draw Polygon
    For m = 1 To sides
        Move Turtle length
        Turn Turtle  360 / sides
    Next m
    ' rotate turtle to roteate the next polygon
    Turn Turtle  360 / polygons
Next p